  "geometry_rule": "Every ignition and magic state is procedurally derived from the corresponding graphite alpha mask without redrawing or repositioning the glyph.",
  "particles": "Ignite 75 uses deterministic fine gold dust and localized glints. Ignite 90 adds the clean continuous core and defined gold envelope. Full magic uses four mask-driven particle scales: fine amber dust, gold motes, pale hot motes, and rare soft white flare points. All remain concentrated around the exact graphite geometry and inside the transparent safety border.",
  "peak_magic_rule": "Full magic is a stable, reference-matched illuminated phase. The approved handwritten stroke remains fully continuous: a thin warm-white core sits inside a softly diffused gold body, broad honey-amber bloom, and surrounding particles. Deterministic low-frequency modulation changes brightness subtly but never removes a section of the stroke. The approved graphite silhouette remains the sole geometry source, and the outer 307 px transparent safety border is hard-enforced."
